    "long_instructions": "## Add Tree 2\r\nGoal: Put Tree 2 on your map. Compare it to Tree 1.\r\n\r\n1. Drag your Data Scientist to **Prepare Stop 2**.\r\n2. Click the zoom **+** in the bottom corner of the map.\r\n3. Open your **Backpack**. Click **+** next to the file that ends in **fixed-tree**.\r\n4. Drag the picture into the \"Add Tree 2 from your Backpack\" box. Drag a corner to make it bigger.\r\n5. Use **Tree 1 vs. Tree 2** in your guide to answer \"What changed?\"\r\n6. Answer the New Problem question.\r\n\r\nYou are done when Tree 2 is on your map and Prepare Stop 2 has an answer.",
